        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema EJAKAIT Samuel atiar, “Itodol ai imonyi kanuka Saul, naarai aŋer eoŋ ŋes araut ekabaka loka Isirael? Kileleb akinyet amumwaratakon, kolot, kejukari jo mama ejai Yese Ebetelekemit: naarai adum ekabaka kodweke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
