            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Samuel Yese atiar, “Ejaas ikonidwe ne kere?” Kotema atiar, “Esalit inoorit, ido koany, ieokie amerekekin.” Kobala Samuel Yese atiar, “Kijuka koomai ŋes: naarai mam kiboikin aitodol neebunio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
