          "text": " Kosodi Samuel alemun amumwarat naka akinyet, kinyonyoik ŋes akinyet kokidin oinacanake: kodoik emoyo loka EJAKAIT Daudi kagogon amear kapaaran kaŋin kaiyatanakin. Konyou Samuel, kolot Rama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
