                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobu Daudi mama ejai Saul, kobwo kakonyeneke: kominakin ŋes noi; koraun loedakit luiiisike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kijuka Saul mama ejai Yese kobala ebe, “Keŋaiŋait, kocamak Daudi abwoenen kakonyeneka; naarai adumu ŋesi asianut kakonyeneka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kanen keiau Saul emoyo loerono loabuni kama ejai EJAKAIT, kolemuni Daudi adeudeu, koram kakekan: kicasi do Saul, konaleuni, konyou emoyo loerono kamake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
